{
  "description": "The creature is depicted in right-facing profile standing upright on two hind legs against a plain off-white background. It has the overall body shape, fur, head, hind legs and long bushy tail of a red fox, with reddish-brown fur on the back, head, sides and tail, and white to light gray fur on the throat, chest and belly, combined with two large folded bird wings attached to the sides of its mid-torso. The wings show mottled tan, cream, brown and gray plumage with dark spots and barring. The head is held high and alert, the wings are folded neatly against the body, and the tail extends back and down with a white tip near the ground.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "fox-like head with a narrow pointed muzzle, black nose, white fur around the mouth and chin, a visible amber eye with whiskers, facing right in profile",
      "where": "at the front top of the body, atop the neck"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two upright triangular pointed ears with reddish-brown outer fur and black and pale inner fur, the nearer ear fully visible",
      "where": "on top of the head"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "two muscular hind legs covered in reddish-brown and grayish fur, bent at the joints in an upright standing posture",
      "where": "extending down from the lower rear torso to the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "two dark brown paws with visible claws and toe pads, flat on the ground",
      "where": "at the ends of the two hind legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long thick bushy tail covered in dense reddish-brown fur with a white tip at the end",
      "where": "extending back and down from the rear of the body, angling toward the ground on the left side of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "two large folded bird wings, the nearer wing prominently displayed with overlapping feathers, the farther wing partially visible beneath the chest",
      "where": "attached to the sides of the mid-torso, folded along the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense overlapping feathers in tan, cream, brown and gray with dark spots and dark barring on the flight feathers",
      "where": "covering both wings"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "reddish-orange fur on the back, head and tail, white and light gray fur on the throat, chest and belly, darker brown on the lower legs, and speckled and barred patterns on the wing feathers",
      "where": "across the body and wings"
    }
  ],
